cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results, please cite them as below."
title: "Twisted group algebras and simple partial comodules of finite group algebras: a counterexample and a classification"
authors:
  - alias: "A-guy-with-AI"
date-released: 2026-11-11
version: "1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/A-guy-with-AI/partial-comodules-A4-counterexample"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - partial comodules
  - partial representations
  - Hopf algebras
  - twisted group algebras
  - counterexample
  - Lean 4
abstract: >-
  Counterexample (A4, dimensions 4 and 8, certified in Lean 4) to Conjecture B of
  Batista-Hautekiet-Saracco-Vercruysse; classification of finite-dimensional simple
  partial comodules of finite group algebras via twisted group algebras; finite
  dimension and semisimplicity of the partial representation algebra of dual group
  algebras in characteristic prime to the group order. Proofs reviewed by AI systems,
  not yet by a human expert.
